      <groundspeak:logs>
        <groundspeak:log id="684672321">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-06T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3061435">Iron Phoenix</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP302 - Drumheller&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for another day of capping and caching with OBA, this time we went east!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; For as many times as I've been in this town (for about 3 months for work) I've never hunted for this (or other) cap before! Today we were on a mission and OBA had this one figured out pretty quick.  Took some digging though, and some disturbing of ants &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_dead.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; but we got it!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; Cap is in surprisingly good shape... just a couple scratches. TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="684654266">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-06T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
