          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP302 – Drumheller

N 51° 27.832 W 112° 42.056&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BCP302 probably took us longer to locate than any other cap today.  My compass picked a spot but despite a lot of poking and digging the cap would not make itself available.  But when Truly2’s metal detector app picked the same spot I moved over a tad, dug a little deeper and hit paydirt.   Thank you for the brass cap outforthehunt.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
